ion. Supporting an impressive test range of up to 300 km, this device is ideal for large-scale fiber deployments, long-haul links, and backbone networks. It delivers highly accurate measurements to ensure network reliability and minimize downtime.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Specifications:</h3><ul><li>Test Range: Up to 300 km (depending on fiber type and testing conditions)</li><li>Wavelengths: 850/1300 nm (multimode), 1310/1550/1625 nm (singlemode)</li><li>Dynamic Range: Up to 45 dB</li><li>Event Dead Zone: ≤ 0.8 meters</li><li>Attenuation Dead Zone: ≤ 2.5 meters</li><li>Measurement Accuracy: ±0.1 dB/dB/km (typical)</li><li>Display: 7-inch color touchscreen for detailed analysis</li><li>Battery Life: Up to 12 hours continuous use</li><li>Connectivity: Wi-Fi, GPS, VNC for remote control and data sharing</li><li>Multi-function: Includes Optical Power Meter, Light Source, Visual Fault Locator, and more</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                           \n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-5 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                    \n\n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-6 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\